			"notes": "**Changelog v0.7.1**\n\n**Added:**\n\n- Zone Distillation II\n- Span Distillation\n- Added config option to blacklist blocks that can be moved by Greater Translocation. The default blacklist includes end portals, end gateways, end portal frames, nether portals, barriers, and command blocks. It also allows toggling the ability to translocate blocks that are tile entities.\n\n**Changed:**\n\n- Adjusted pricing of Greater Translocation.\n- Greater Translocation now has a limited range of 30,000 blocks and properly respects ambit.\n- Greater Translocation can now move tile entities if enabled in the config, although it will drop or destroy all the items.\n- Rotate will now cost 1 amethyst shard when used on other players.\n- Rotate: Block will no longer rotate blocks with high explosion resistance.\n- Removed Add Gravity.\n- Twokai's Ideal Condition no longer affects entities without gravity.\n\n**Fixed:**\n\n- Optimized and stabilized Propulsion and Twokai's Ideal Condition.\n- Propulsion cost is now correctly matched to its description.\n- Shooter Purification had an incorrect description.\n- Shooter Purification now respects ambit even with players.\n- Twokai's Ideal Condition should no longer boost players when they are using elytra."
		},
